  </p>

  <h2 id="hybrid-paths">The hybrid paths most comparison articles do not mention</h2>

  <p>
    Framing this as a strict either/or misses how the market actually hires writers in 2026. A meaningful and
    growing set of roles sit deliberately between the two.
  </p>

